WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:05.720
Units: the I H S C G A schedule, each guard, and its director.

00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:12.928
When I H S C G A sends the schedule, copy the whole table out of the P D F and paste it here.

00:00:13.128 --> 00:00:29.480
Preview shows what it read: inspection, warm-up area, holding and performance times. Breaks and awards become markers; exhibitions become guards. Then Import. Re-importing a new version only changes times; every tap stays.

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:41.531
Each guard, in performance order, with its times and home room. The times drive the guides' screens and the board's flags. Home rooms are the hallway areas on the sheet's Areas tab.

00:00:41.731 --> 00:00:48.910
Copy director link gives a director a view of their own guard and the one before them, with no phone numbers.

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:59.900
Edit has every schedule time, the warm-up area, the home room, and the director. Director phone and email only show for roles with Director contact.

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:06.630
A director's link shows their guard and the one before them, live, so they know when they're up.

00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:18.220
The steps, by track: director, guard, equipment, props, and together. Which station taps which steps, and which screen it opens on, is on the sheet's Groups tab.

00:01:19.070 --> 00:01:21.720
Next: access.
